WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.336
Welcome!

00:00:00.336 --> 00:00:06.720
In this video, we'll review how to register for an Amazon Ads account and how to navigate the available

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.400
features in the advertising console.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.080
To get started, visit ads.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:11.616
amazon.

00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:13.760
com and click Register.

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.720
Choose the country where you'd like to advertise, then pick the option that applies to you.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:24.240
Once you've registered, you'll create and manage your sponsored ads campaigns in the Campaign Manager.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:29.520
This page shows a single view of your ad campaigns so you can easily create new campaigns,

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:33.120
as well as track your total spend, total sales, and more.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:35.936
Click Create Campaign to get started.

00:00:35.936 --> 00:00:40.160
Choose from sponsored products, sponsored brands, or sponsored display.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.944
Launch your first campaign in a matter of minutes.

00:00:42.944 --> 00:00:44.800
Once you've created a few campaigns,

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:50.080
you can use portfolios to simplify your day-to-day campaign management in multiple ways.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:55.040
Organize your campaigns by brand, category, product, or season.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.920
Whatever makes the most sense for you and your business.

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:03.360
You can track portfolio performance and create reports for campaigns by portfolio.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:08.160
Portfolios also include automatic budget capping and simple invoicing.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:13.360
From the advertising console, you can also use Amazon's self-service store builder,

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:17.440
located in the Stores tab, to create and edit your store.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:23.040
It's easy to create a multi-page experience and there's no design expertise necessary.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:29.816
Amazon stores allow you to showcase your brand and products in a multi-page, immersive shopping

00:01:29.816 --> 00:01:30.240
experience.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:35.265
In the Measurement and Reporting tab, you'll find sponsored ads reports that show account-level

00:01:35.265 --> 00:01:35.600
data

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.980
for all your campaigns.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:41.120
You can use this data to understand how your campaigns are performing

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.000
and optimize current and future campaigns.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.880
You can also access Amazon attribution

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:52.960
for your non-Amazon campaigns across channels like email, social media, and more.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:58.000
Once you've registered for an Amazon ads account, you are ready to begin creating your first

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:02.633
campaign through the advertising console.

00:02:02.633 --> 00:02:04.487
Visit ads.

00:02:04.487 --> 00:02:05.413
amazon.

00:02:05.413 --> 00:02:09.120
com to get started.
